other hand, there are $4$ columns in $B$ and $4$ rows in $A.$ Since the number of columns in $B$ equals the number of rows in $A,$ the matrices $B$ and $A$ are conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{B}_{2\\times \\boxed{\\text{4}}}{\\times }_{✓}{A}_{\\boxed{\\text{4}}\\times 2}=\\text{well defined}\n$$\n\nFinally, there are $2$ columns in $A$ and $2$ rows in $C.$ Since the number of columns in $A$ equals the number of rows in $C,$ the matrices $A$ and $C$ are conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{A}_{4\\times \\boxed{\\text{2}}}{\\times }_{✓}{C}_{\\boxed{\\text{2}}\\times 2}=\\text{well defined}\n$$\n\nWe conclude that all three statements are true."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186101410 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186100870 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "f38167e2-3c1d-5c00-9691-ba8e6ac6fdce" :knowledge-point/title "Determining the Dimension of the Product of Two Matrices Given the Dimensions of the Factors" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186048783 :topic/title "Conformability for Matrix Multiplication"}]}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c11db5d3-1277-54b9-b413-c357eb5a8d5b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5 \\times 3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186099622} {:answer/id #uuid "003a73bd-74ce-5411-b64d-dc9c531773a8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5 \\times 5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186099623} {:answer/id #uuid "384b653b-bec8-59b8-88ea-dd5a8a111aff" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3 \\times 5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186099624} {:answer/id #uuid "67105420-cd2f-56f4-9f93-073d021db212" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "The product is undefined" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186099625} {:answer/id #uuid "73e775c0-bc52-5b40-8d57-9b9a3197174c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answ